---
import Layout from '../layouts/Layout.astro';
import Closing from '../components/Closing.astro';
import { brand, path } from '../data/site';
import Arrow from '../components/Arrow.astro';
import EditorialImage from '../components/EditorialImage.astro';
---
<Layout active="about" title="Meet Stephanie Kopacek" description="Meet Stephanie Kopacek, founder of Form + Field in Larkspur, Colorado. Private Pilates instruction and BTMM-certified equine bodywork with individual attention.">
  <section class="text-hero wrap section"><p class="eyebrow">Meet the founder</p><h1>Stephanie<br /><em>Kopacek.</em></h1><div class="text-hero-bottom"><p>A curious eye for movement.<br />A considered approach to every body.</p><span class="eyebrow">{brand.location}</span></div></section>
  <section class="wrap section editorial-split"><div><p class="eyebrow">The person behind the practice</p><h2>Observe first.<br /><em>Build from there.</em></h2><EditorialImage slot="stephanie-portrait" class="split-image" sizes="(max-width: 1023px) 90vw, 35vw" /></div><div class="prose"><p>Stephanie founded {brand.name} around a shared interest in how people and horses move. Her practice brings private Pilates instruction together with equine bodywork and an interest in the horse-and-rider relationship.</p><p>She holds a Balance Through Movement Method certification and is completing her Polestar Pilates education/certification. Her work with horses informs a practice centered on observation, body awareness, balance, and movement.</p><p>In each session, the focus is individual: understand the starting point, make room for questions, and work thoughtfully toward the client’s goals.</p></div></section>
  <section class="sage-section"><div class="wrap section editorial-split"><div><p class="eyebrow">Education & practice</p><h2>A foundation<br /><em>for thoughtful work.</em></h2></div><div class="credential-list"><article><span class="eyebrow">Certification</span><h3>Balance Through Movement Method</h3><p>Equine movement and bodywork.</p></article><article><span class="eyebrow">Education in progress</span><h3>Polestar Pilates</h3><p>Completing Pilates education/certification.</p></article><article><span class="eyebrow">Current practice</span><h3>Private instruction & equine bodywork</h3><p>Individual sessions in Larkspur, Colorado.</p></article></div></div></section>
  <section class="wrap section editorial-split"><p class="eyebrow">The philosophy</p><div><h2>Good movement begins<br /><em>with paying attention.</em></h2><p class="support-copy">The approach is simple: observe, listen, and make the work personal. Strength and precision have room to coexist with patience and curiosity.</p><a class="text-link" href={path('horse-rider')}>The horse + rider connection <Arrow /></a></div></section>
  <Closing title="Meet in movement." />
</Layout>
